  "ruleText": "Cmp 103.01 Addressed to Director. All requests to the commission for information under RSA 541-A:16, I (a) shall be sent to the director in writing at the following address:\n\nChrista McAuliffe Planetarium\n\n3 Institute Dr.\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\nSource. #7368, eff 9-27-00",
